","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"8c0d901a-db0e-11ef-9b40-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","place_note":"府安邑，山西夏县","start_index":47,"tongjian_id":"8c0d901b-db0e-11ef-b6d8-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河南","place_name_jianti_auto":"河南","start_index":51,"tongjian_id":"8c0d901c-db0e-11ef-a3e9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"長社","place_name_jianti_auto":"长社","start_index":53,"tongjian_id":"8c0d901d-db0e-11ef-8727-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"解縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"解县","start_index":57,"tongjian_id":"8c0d901e-db0e-11ef-8cfc-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"濁水","place_name_jianti_auto":"浊水","start_index":59,"tongjian_id":"8c0d901f-db0e-11ef-9a36-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":63,"tongjian_id":"8c0d9020-db0e-11ef-8653-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"史記正義曰：徐廣以爲長社濁澤，非也。括地志云：濁水源出蒲州解縣東北平地，爾時魏都安邑，韓、趙伐魏，豈至河南長社邪！解縣濁水近於魏都，當是也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"史记正义曰：徐广以为长社浊泽，非也。括地志云：浊水源出蒲州解县东北平地，尔时魏都安邑，韩、赵伐魏，岂至河南长社邪！解县浊水近于魏都，当是也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":53,"tongjian_id":"8c0d900f-db0e-11ef-bb57-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"大夫","official_note":"大夫是古代中国的高级官职，通常指中央或诸侯国的官员，负责行政、军事或顾问职责。在《资治通鉴》此段中，王錯作为魏国的大夫，出奔韩国，反映了魏国内乱和官员流亡的情况。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"魏大夫王錯出奔韓","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"b8d9aa2a-fd2a-4b86-b5cf-fdb8e9905e41"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-400,"link_death_year":-319,"link_td_description":"魏惠王，本名魏罃，一作魏婴，魏武侯之子，生于魏文侯二十五年（前400年），全谥为魏文惠王或魏惠成王，通称魏惠王，战国时期魏国的第三代君主，在位期间为前370年－前319年。原本为侯，五国相王后称王，在位时期魏国由盛至衰。《孟子》一书中又称其为梁惠王，《庄子》中称文惠君。","link_td_id":"Q10000501","link_td_number_id":334595,"people_name":"罃","people_name_jianti_auto":"䓨","people_xingming":"魏罃","start_index":59,"tongjian_id":"8c0d9030-db0e-11ef-9514-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-400,"link_death_year":-319,"link_t