76ae2","source_start_index":12,"source_text":"《竹书》：魏惠成王元年，韩伐魏，军于捴泽陂，北对鸡鸣城。是也。"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/一、开封府（卷四十七）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"3魏大夫王錯出奔韓。公孫頎謂韓懿侯曰：「魏亂，可取也。」懿侯乃與趙成侯合兵伐魏，戰于濁澤，大破之，遂圍魏。成侯曰：「殺罃，立公中緩，割地而退，我二國之利也。」懿侯曰：「不可。殺魏君，暴也；割地而退，貪也。不如兩分之。魏分爲兩，不強於宋、衞，則我終無魏患矣。」趙人不聽。懿侯不悅，以其兵夜去。趙成侯亦去。罃遂殺公中緩而立，是爲惠王。","content_fanyi":"魏国大夫王错出逃到韩国。公孙颀对韩懿侯说：“魏国混乱，可以攻取。”韩懿侯便与赵成侯合兵攻打魏国，在浊泽交战，大败魏军，随后包围了魏国都城。赵成侯说：“杀掉魏罃，改立公中缓，让魏国割地后退兵，这对我们两国都有利。”韩懿侯说：“不行。杀掉魏国国君，是暴虐；割地后退兵，是贪婪。不如让魏国一分为二。魏国分成两国后，国力就不会强于宋国、卫国，我们便永远不会再有魏国的祸患了。”赵成侯不肯听从。韩懿侯很不高兴，当夜率领自己的军队撤走。赵成侯也撤兵离去。魏罃于是杀死公中缓，自立为国君，这就是魏惠王。","content_jianti_auto":"3魏大夫王错出奔韩。公孙颀谓韩懿侯曰：「魏乱，可取也。」懿侯乃与赵成侯合兵伐魏，战于浊泽，大破之，遂围魏。成侯曰：「杀䓨，立公中缓，割地而退，我二国之利也。」懿侯曰：「不可。杀魏君，暴也；割地而退，贪也。不如两分之。魏分为两，不强于宋、衞，则我终无魏患矣。」赵人不听。懿侯不悦，以其兵夜去。赵成侯亦去。䓨遂杀公中缓而立，是为惠王。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":111,"number":3,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一 (周紀一) / 烈王 / 七年 / 第 3 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8c0d8feb-db0e-11ef-9580-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-369},"tongjian_id":"8c0d8feb-db0e-11ef-9580-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":2},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"索隱曰：蓋古人之言及俗說，故云「故曰」。適，讀曰嫡。","note_content_jianti_auto":"索隐曰：盖古人之言及俗说，故云「故曰」。适，读曰嫡。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":57,"tongjian_id":"8c0d903f-db0e-11ef-9357-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-400,"link_death_year":-319,"link_td_description":"魏惠王，本名魏罃，一作魏婴，魏武侯之子，生于魏文侯二十五年（前400年），全谥为魏文惠王或魏惠成王，通称魏惠王，战国时期魏国的第三代君主，在位期间为前370年－前319年。原本为侯，五国相王后称王，在位时期魏国由盛至衰。《孟子》一书中又称其为梁惠王，《庄子》中称文惠君。","link_td_id":"Q10000501","link_td_number_id":334595,"people_name":"魏惠王","people_name_jianti_auto":"魏惠王","people_xingming":"魏惠王","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"8c0d9042-db0e-11ef-b833-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"太史公曰：魏惠王所以身不死、國不分者，二國之謀不和也。若從一家之謀，魏必分矣。故曰：「君終，無適子，其國可破也。」","content_fanyi":"太史公司马迁说：魏惠王之所以自身不死、国家没有被瓜分，是因为韩、赵两国的计策不一致。如果采纳其中任何一国的计策，魏国必定被瓜分。所以说：“国君去世而没有嫡子，他的国家就可以被攻破。”","content_jianti_auto":"太史公曰：魏惠王所以身不死、国不分者，二国之谋不和也。若从一家之谋，魏必分矣。故曰：「君终，无适子，其国可破也。」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":112,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一 (周紀一) / 烈王 / 七年 / 第 4 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8c0d903e-db0e-11ef-854a-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-369},"tongjian_id":"8c0d903e-db0e-11ef-854a-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":3},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb13-db0e-11ef-be87-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"劉向","people_name_jianti_auto":"刘向","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb14-db0e-11ef-b85e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"申子","people_name_jianti_auto":"申子","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb15-db0e-11ef-93de-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"太史公","people_name_jianti_auto":"太史公","start_index":58,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb16-db0e-11ef-a1f1-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"劉原父","people_name_jianti_auto":"刘原父","start_index":73,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb17-db0e-11ef-8c8d-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"衞侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"衞侯","start_index":104,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb18-db0e-11ef-a757-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"衞侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"衞侯","start_index":114,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb19-db0e-11ef-a6f8-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"公孫","people_name_jianti_auto":"公孙","start_index":119,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb1a-db0e-11ef-b0e9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"衞","place_name_jianti_auto":"衞","start_index":100,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb1b-db0e-11ef-87a6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：劉向別錄云：申子學好刑名。刑名者，循名以責實，其尊君卑臣，崇上抑下，合於六經。說者曰：刑，刑家；名，名家；卽太史公所論六家之二也。此說非。劉原父曰：刑名，卽幷學兩家術耳。公孫非姓氏，以其先出於衞，父爲衞侯則稱爲公子，祖爲衞侯則稱爲公孫。鞅，於兩翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：刘向别录云：申子学好刑名。刑名者，循名以责实，其尊君卑臣，崇上抑下，合于六经。说者曰：刑，刑家；名，名家；即太史公所论六家之二也。此说非。刘原父曰：刑名，即幷学两家术耳。公孙非姓氏，以其先出于衞，父为衞侯则称为公子，祖为衞侯则称为公孙。鞅，于两翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb12-db0e-11ef-a867-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb20-db0e-11ef-866c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb21-db0e-11ef-afb7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『章：十二行本二字互乙；乙十一行本同；孔本同。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『章：十二行本二字互乙；乙十一行本同；孔本同。』","note_type":"『章：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb1f-db0e-11ef-bb87-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":50,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb1e-db0e-11ef-b69b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"相，息亮翻。痤，才戈翻。不可諱，謂死也。俗語有之：「人不諱死。」","note_content_jianti_auto":"相，息亮翻。痤，才戈翻。不可讳，谓死也。俗语有之：「人不讳死。」","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb22-db0e-11ef-8b0a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"戰國","place_name_jianti_auto":"战国","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb24-db0e-11ef-81f1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"自戰國以來，大夫之家有中庶子，有舍人。","note_content_jianti_auto":"自战国以来，大夫之家有中庶子，有舍人。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":74,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb23-db0e-11ef-b0da-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"先、後，皆去聲。","note_content_jianti_auto":"先、后，皆去声。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":138,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb27-db0e-11ef-af02-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"此先、後，皆如字。爲，于僞翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"此先、后，皆如字。为，于伪翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":149,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb28-db0e-11ef-b5e9-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"康","people_name_jianti_auto":"康","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb2c-db0e-11ef-ae94-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"景","people_name_jianti_auto":"景","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb2d-db0e-11ef-b543-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"楚","place_name_jianti_auto":"楚","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb2e-db0e-11ef-91bc-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"嬖，博計翻，又卑義翻。史記正義：監，甲暫翻。康曰：景，姓，楚之族。監，古銜切，非。","note_content_jianti_auto":"嬖，博计翻，又卑义翻。史记正义：监，甲暂翻。康曰：景，姓，楚之族。监，古衔切，非。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":245,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb2b-db0e-11ef-84de-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"公","official_note":"在《资治通鉴》中，“公”常作为对诸侯或高级官员的尊称，此处“魏相公叔痤”指魏国的相国公叔痤，公叔痤是魏国的相国，属于中枢机构的高官，负责辅佐国君处理政务。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"魏相公叔痤","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"1c669029-1e30-40fb-bb0a-8b24b607c657"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"中枢近臣","official_name":"中庶子","official_note":"中庶子是战国时期诸侯国中的官职，通常负责侍从、文书或顾问工作，此处指公叔痤的中庶子卫鞅，表明卫鞅在魏国担任此职，是公叔痤的属官。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"痤之中庶子衞鞅","start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"ca22a77a-d20f-40e9-9006-71146f5153fc"},{"confidence":0.8,"official_category":"宫廷侍从","official_name":"嬖臣","official_note":"嬖臣指受君主宠幸的近臣或侍从，此处景监是秦孝公的嬖臣，卫鞅通过他求见孝公，表明嬖臣在宫廷中具有接近君主的特权，常参与引荐或顾问事务。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"因嬖臣景監以求見孝公","start_index":200,"tongjian_id":"154850d8-44d4-47b3-830c-5fb7007cea22"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-400,"link_death_year":-319,"link_td_description":"魏惠王，本名魏罃，一作魏婴，魏武侯之子，生于魏文侯二十五年（前400年），全谥为魏文惠王或魏惠成王，通称魏惠王，战国时期魏国的第三代君主，在位期间为前370年－前319年。原本为侯，五国相王后称王，在位时期魏国由盛至衰。《孟子》一书中又称其为梁惠王，《庄子》中称文惠君。","link_td_id":"Q10000501","link_td_number_id":334595,"people_name":"魏惠王","people_name_jianti_auto":"魏惠王","people_xingming":"魏罃","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"8c24bafa-db0e-11ef-a34e-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[魏罃]"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"容斋随笔/秦用他国人","excerpts":[{"context_after":"。其它若楼缓赵人，张仪、魏冉、范睢皆魏人，蔡泽燕人，吕不...","context_before":"...仲、公叔，赵之奉阳、平原君，魏王至以太子为相。独秦不然，","source_end_index":92,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"6e15c2e4-f2d3-4bfd-b268-aaf88f22dfd7","source_start_index":74,"source_text":"其始与之谋国以开霸业者，魏人公孙鞅也"}],"path":"随笔/卷二/秦用他国人","source_name":"容斋随笔"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷五十二）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"其尽得河西，则犀首张仪之力也]。《吕氏春秋》：吴起去西河...","context_before":"...摎留谓韩王，魏两用犀首张仪，而西河之外亡。是也[吕氏曰：","source_end_index":442,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8e5a0768-dfec-539f-9b20-8e795d4ab86a","source_start_index":430,"source_text":"秦孝公用商鞅，取河西地。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷五十二）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"公孫鞅者，衞之庶孫也。好刑名之學。事魏相公叔痤，痤知其賢，未及進。會病，魏惠王往問之曰：「公叔病如有不可諱，將柰社稷何？」公叔曰：「痤之中庶子衞鞅，年雖少，有奇才，願君舉國而聽之！」王嘿然。公叔曰：「君卽不聽用鞅，必殺之，無令出境！」王許諾而去。公叔召鞅謝曰：「吾先君而後臣，故先爲君謀，後以告子。子必速行矣！」鞅曰：「君不能用子之言任臣，又安能用子之言殺臣乎！」卒不去。王出，謂左右曰：「公叔病甚，悲乎，欲令寡人以國聽衞鞅也！旣又勸寡人殺之，豈不悖哉！」衞鞅旣至秦，因嬖臣景監以求見孝公，說以富國強兵之術；公大悅，與議國事。","content_fanyi":"公孙鞅，是卫侯的庶出孙辈。他爱好法家刑名之学。他侍奉魏国宰相公叔痤，公叔痤知道他贤能，但还没有来得及向国君推荐进用。恰逢公叔痤生病，魏惠王前去探望，问他说：“公叔万一有什么不测，国家该怎么办？”公叔痤说：“我手下的中庶子卫鞅，年纪虽轻，却有奇才，希望您把整个国家都交给他治理！”魏惠王沉默不语。公叔痤又说：“您如果不听从我的建议任用卫鞅，就一定要杀掉他，不要让他离开国境！”魏惠王答应后便离去了。公叔痤把卫鞅叫来，向他谢罪说：“我应当先为国君着想，再为臣下着想，所以先替国君出主意杀掉你，之后才把话告诉你。你一定要赶快逃走！”卫鞅说：“国君不能采用您的话任用我，又怎能采用您的话杀掉我呢？”最终没有逃离。魏惠王出来以后，对左右近臣说：“公叔痤病得这么重，真是可悲啊！他竟想让寡人把国家大权交给卫鞅，随后又劝寡人杀掉他，这难道不是荒谬吗！”卫鞅到了秦国以后，通过宠臣景监求见秦孝公，向他游说富国强兵的策略；秦孝公大为高兴，与他商议国家大事。","content_jianti_auto":"公孙鞅者，衞之庶孙也。好刑名之学。事魏相公叔痤，痤知其贤，未及进。会病，魏惠王往问之曰：「公叔病如有不可讳，将柰社稷何？」公叔曰：「痤之中庶子衞鞅，年虽少，有奇才，愿君举国而听之！」王嘿然。公叔曰：「君即不听用鞅，必杀之，无令出境！」王许诺而去。公叔召鞅谢曰：「吾先君而后臣，故先为君谋，后以告子。子必速行矣！」鞅曰：「君不能用子之言任臣，又安能用子之言杀臣乎！」卒不去。王出，谓左右曰：「公叔病甚，悲乎，欲令寡人以国听衞鞅也！既又劝寡人杀之，岂不悖哉！」衞鞅既至秦，因嬖臣景监以求见孝公，说以富国强兵之术；公大悦，与议国事。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":125,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二 (周紀二) / 顯王 / 八年 / 第 2 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb11-db0e-11ef-bc51-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-361},"tongjian_id":"8c22eb11-db0e-11ef-bc51-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":4},{"mention_count":4,"paragraph_brief":{"paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8c27e65a-db0e-11ef-b4c8-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"瑕丘檀城","place_name_jianti_auto":"瑕丘檀城","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"8c27e65b-db0e-11ef-8a14-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"姓譜云：齊公族有食采於瑕丘檀城，因以爲氏。","note_content_jianti_auto":"姓谱云：齐公族有食采于瑕丘檀城，因以为氏。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":99,"tongjian_id":"8c27e659-db0e-11ef-91a7-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8c27e65e-db0e-11ef-9668-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"南城","place_name_jianti_auto":"南城","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"8c27e65f-db0e-11ef-9c08-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"城在齊之南境，故曰南城。","note_content_jianti_auto":"城在齐之南境，故曰南城。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":104,"tongjian_id":"8c27e65d-db0e-11ef-9c41-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"丁度","people_name_jianti_auto":"丁度","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"8c27e662-db0e-11ef-9325-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"盼子","people_name_jianti_auto":"盼子","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"8c27e663-db0e-11ef-9471-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"田盼","people_name_jianti_auto":"田盼","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"8c27e664-db0e-11ef-b307-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"班","people_name_jianti_auto":"班","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"8c27e665-db0e-11ef-bbef-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"杜預","people_name_jianti_auto":"杜预","start_index":47,"tongjian_id":"8c27e666-db0e-11ef-916e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"宋白","people_name_jianti_auto":"宋白","start_index":60,"tongjian_id":"8c27e667-db0e-11ef-aa91-